        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (60–80 words).** Write how you use the internet and where you get your news.\n\n**Speak (about 1 minute).** Say aloud what you do online every day and what you could not live without."
